@direction LR
@spacing 60

[1 - We set up your Claude account on a plan that includes Cowork] -> [2 - We install Claude on your computer and open Cowork]
[2 - We install Claude on your computer and open Cowork] -> [3 - You give Claude one folder for your notes, files and drafts]
[3 - You give Claude one folder for your notes, files and drafts] -> [4 - We connect the email, calendar and files you already use]
[4 - We connect the email, calendar and files you already use] -> [5 - You tell Claude once how you write and how you like to sign off]
[5 - You tell Claude once how you write and how you like to sign off] -> [6 - Your first skill drafts a reply to every new inquiry]
[6 - Your first skill drafts a reply to every new inquiry] -> [7 - Your second skill turns rough notes into a polished document]
[7 - Your second skill turns rough notes into a polished document] -> [8 - Your third skill writes you a weekly summary of your inbox]
[8 - Your third skill writes you a weekly summary of your inbox] -> [9 - Your fourth skill turns your notes into a social post or newsletter]
[9 - Your fourth skill turns your notes into a social post or newsletter] -> [10 - We test each skill on a real example from your week]
[10 - We test each skill on a real example from your week] -> [11 - Nothing sends on its own, so every draft waits for your OK]
[11 - Nothing sends on its own, so every draft waits for your OK] -> [12 - Each week, the task that took up your time becomes a new skill]
